[{"id":164771687,"discussion_id":"9d1d6e672e212c428d51b658c2899d8081b1b044","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-nn/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| norm | ✅ [*zhou-qilong*](https://gitcode.com/zhou-qilong), [*tangweiwei2*](https://gitcode.com/tangweiwei2) (2/2) | ✅ [*zhou-qilong*](https://gitcode.com/zhou-qilong) (1/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n","created_at":"2026-03-10T11:28:15+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-11T15:20:24+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":164771704,"discussion_id":"72f803863477310c6ea8328a82a1e756366dd860","body":"### CLA Signature Pass  \n raoliang_sac, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1: ","created_at":"2026-03-10T11:28:18+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-10T11:28:18+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":164771712,"discussion_id":"2c3836939b8976d8ec633fdd8fc996c298a98540","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-03-10T11:28:21+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-10T11:28:21+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":164771836,"discussion_id":"a7be209827881b717edd27ba85cf5d38fb4ad345","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n修复RMSNorm计算内核在处理尾部数据时可能存在的逻辑错误。原代码在尾部数据长度`tail`为零时，仍会无条件执行归约求和计算，可能导致访问未初始化缓冲区或执行无效计算，存在潜在未定义行为和资源浪费的风险。本次修改旨在通过增加边界条件检查，提升代码在边缘情况下的健壮性和执行效率。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n在`ComputeFormer`函数的Stage2（尾部数据处理阶段）之后，将原本无条件的归约求和计算（`RmsNorm::ComputeSum`和`RmsNorm::ComputeMultiLevelReduce`）包裹在条件判断`if (tail > 0)`中。此修改确保了仅在存在有效尾部数据时才执行相关计算，避免了在`tail`为零时对临时缓冲区进行无效操作，从而消除了潜在的不确定性和资源消耗，保证了计算逻辑的正确性。","created_at":"2026-03-10T11:28:58+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-10T11:28:58+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":164894412,"discussion_id":"68ac014feea88ecdd7eb2258d3a7b3c4150bca5e","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-03-11T10:52:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-11T10:52:00+08:00","user":{"id":"68c94ebce53de9418257b095","login":"raoliang_sac","object_id":"68c94ebce53de9418257b095","name":"raoliang_sac","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/raoliang